{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27320","headline":"公无渡河 · 陈标","name":"公无渡河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴云飒飒浪花愁，半度惊湍半挂舟。\n声尽云天君不住，命悬鱼鳖妾同休。\n黛娥芳脸垂珠泪，罗袜香裾赴碧流。\n余魄岂能衔木石，独将遗恨付箜篌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}